## Notes / Limitations

This is an **ideal transmission-line** matching design intended to study the gain–noise–match trade-space cleanly.  

A layout-ready implementation would include:
- Substrate-backed physical lines (microstrip or CPW)
- Losses and discontinuities
- Wideband stability analysis
- A complete bias network
- EM-aware validation